# fleet-logging reads no environment variables of its own.
#
# `python-dotenv` is a dependency of load_config() only: if a *consumer*
# of this library has a .env file, load_config() loads it so its values
# participate in the same env-override precedence as any other
# environment variable (env var > yaml file value > dataclass default).
#
# This file exists so that question doesn't need re-asking, not because
# there is anything to configure here.
